## Future Extensibility

To add "LostChild" as a new system folder:
1. Define a profile in PROFILE_REGISTRY with the right constraints and query functions
2. Add a FolderItem to systemFolders with `profile: 'lost-child'`

No other code changes. No ID checks to add. No type checks to update. The profile's query functions define the behavior. The system just calls them.
